        "title": "DC Police Station Master API",
        "description": "API provides list of the Police Stations (police_station) and relevant Police Station Codes (police_station_code) used in the establishment for further accessing relevant APIs. Input for this API is Establishment Code and other details. Police Station Name and Police Station Code retrieved using this API can be used to access the case data using Case Search API like Search by FIR Number etc."
